            <ArticleTitle>[The social hygienic significance of the consultative diagnostic care].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>3-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>To determine the potential need in medical technologies based on Novosibirsk regional clinical diagnostic center data, the social hygienic evaluation of the population pathology detection during medical consulting care was organized. It is established that the detection of diseases of thyroid gland, bronchial asthma, hypertension, urolithiasis, duodenal ulcer chronic hepatitis, hepatocirrhosis, and allergic rhinitis is the most important issue in the social hygienic evaluation of prevalence of pathologic affection.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
